Orbis: no Mozilla partner distribution in the MSIX.

mach repackage msix always adds this template's distribution.ini (id=mozilla-MSIX, about=Windows MSIX
package, "Author: Mozilla") before any other distribution folder, and skips later files with the same name.
The About dialog would then show "Windows MSIX package" and "mozilla-MSIX - 1.0". Orbis ships no
distribution.ini at all: its distribution folder holds only policies.json. The file is used only by
msix.py (and a UITour test); no build step reads it. See docs/PATCHES.md and docs/MSIX.md.

